      <uighur>ülekekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>үлээх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>YLEGE-</transcript>
      <definition>[as yledege-] v. t. To leave over; to make unnecessary, superfluous</definition>
      <page>1004</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠥᠯᠠᠺᠠᠺᠥ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ ᠢᠳᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--ky ygei ideky</transcript>
          <definition> To eat without leaving anything</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠶᠠᠭᠤᠨ ᠢ ᠴᠤ ᠥᠯᠠᠺᠠᠭᠰᠡᠨ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
